[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114858016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117752#issuecomment-4114858016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117752","id":4114858016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71Q8Ag","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T01:58:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T01:58:44Z","body":"I can confirm this issue using my own scene, but for Windows (11) and Linux (Fedora 43) on the same machine (no virtual machine). This has been around for quite some time, I believe even before 4.5 . Have you tested any older version than 4.5?\n\nFor me however, when importing the model on platform 2 after baking the light map on platform 1, a new unwrap cache is created. Haven't looked into this yet, but my assumption is that it originated from floating point differences, causing the hash to change and resulting in a new unwrap (given xatlas is likely not cross-platform deterministic, the new uv map is misaligned). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114858016/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4117263501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117752#issuecomment-4117263501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117752","id":4117263501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71aHSN","user":{"login":"madsbangh","id":2969321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjkzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2969321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh","html_url":"https://github.com/madsbangh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T10:57:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:50:55Z","body":"> I can confirm this issue using my own scene, but for Windows (11) and Linux (Fedora 43) on the same machine (no virtual machine). This has been around for quite some time, I believe even before 4.5 . Have you tested any older version than 4.5?\n> \n> For me however, when importing the model on platform 2 after baking the light map on platform 1, a new unwrap cache is created. Haven't looked into this yet, but my assumption is that it originated from floating point differences, causing the hash to change and resulting in a new unwrap (given xatlas is likely not cross-platform deterministic, the new uv map is misaligned).\n\nThanks. That is good to know it is not just me. I want to test it on Mac vs Linux now, as soon as I get the chance.\nI didn't manage to test it on 4.4 and below yet, but I would like to do that as well.\n\nInterestingly, when we tested this, we got identical unwrap_cache files as well, despite the issue being reproducible.\nOur method was\n- Import and bake on platform 1\n- Send over the project and open it on platform 2\n- Observe the issues\n- Compare file hashes for all files (.glb, .glb.import, unwrap_cache, .lmbake, .tscn)\n- Observe the files were identical.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4117263501/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4255963487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117752#issuecomment-4255963487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117752","id":4255963487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79rNlf","user":{"login":"madsbangh","id":2969321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjkzMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2969321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh","html_url":"https://github.com/madsbangh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsbangh/subscriptions","organizations_url"